d>experiments/historical_m5_embedded.json；experiments/m5_raw_trials/</td><td>各自run_id、计划、样本及用户态计数；纯离线复算。</td></tr><tr><td>E01 RTT</td><td>experiments/supplement_20261008/rtt_summary_01/；rtt_A_*、rtt_C_*</td><td>逐次记录、校准、样本分母和分位算法。</td></tr><tr><td>E02—E05原语</td><td>experiments/supplement_20261008/primitives_formal_01/</td><td>19组合×5重复；BENCH_SUMMARY与原stdout。</td></tr><tr><td>E06/E07</td><td>experiments/supplement_20261008/e06_summary_01/；memory_summary_01/</td><td>逐批操作、PID、采样值与OS高水位。</td></tr><tr><td>E09/E10</td><td>experiments/supplement_20261008/tcp_formal_01/；ber_formal_01/</td><td>按scope区分攻击输入、记录损坏和正常对照。</td></tr><tr><td>G01—G07</td><td>experiments/focused_retest_v11/；verification/focused_v11_review/</td><td>原始回传与复核更正并存，不改原日志。</td></tr><tr><td>G3/旧SM4</td><td>experiments/submission_repair_20261008/</td><td>UI换钥和另一SM4 run_id 单独归档。</td></tr><tr><td>E08新扫描/回归/短流程</td><td>02_evidence/</td><td>处置、工具链、构建、定向回归及正式EXE关联。</td></tr><tr><td>本版指标与引用</td><td>report/METRICS_MASTER_v15.json；report/REFERENCE_MAP_v15.json</td><td>主值、原始来源、计算口径与引用映射；本试版已随包提供。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>从包根目录执行以下只读复核命令；完整实验命令与环境保留在各批次原始回执。</p><pre>python tools/verify_release.py --root .
